  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>At 20th level, the ethermagus may create or dismiss his void blade as a swift action. He may also use the weight of the void class feature one additional time per day. Finally, the pressing void and weight of the void class features can now have a single nonshape manifestation that is compatible with the lesser blast etherheart added to them.</p>\n<hr>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/ethermagus#toc22\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
